---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import { chartExample } from '../../data/chart-example.ts';
---
<section class="outputs-story wrap" aria-labelledby="outputs-title">
 <div class="outputs-heading" id="save-and-export"><h2 id="outputs-title">保存与导出</h2><p>草稿用于继续编辑，<br />图片用于查看与分享。</p></div>
 <div class="outputs-spread">
  <article class="draft-output"><div class="draft-output-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="saved-document"><div class="saved-document-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M10 10h80v80H10zM10 30h80M10 70h80M30 10v80M70 10v80"/></svg></div><strong>.ziwei</strong><span>知几草稿</span><div class="saved-document-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="saved-document-shadow"></div></div>
   <div class="output-description"><h3>把工作留在草稿里</h3><p>保存命盘参数、显示状态、全部标注与显隐。<br />打开最近的草稿，继续上一次推敲。</p><a class="text-link" href="/guide/#save">草稿与文件操作 <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a></div>
  </article>
  <article class="image-output" data-output-preview data-output-scale="2"><div class="image-output-art"><div class="export-document"><header><span>知几</span><span>甲子年 · 固定示例</span></header><div class="export-document-chart" aria-hidden="true">{chartExample.cells.map(cell=><div class:list={{'is-empty':!cell}}>{cell&&<><small>{cell.palace}</small><strong>{cell.stars.slice(0,2).join(' ')}</strong></>}</div>)}</div><footer><span>PNG</span><strong data-output-factor>2×</strong></footer></div></div>
   <div class="output-description"><div class="output-title-row"><h3>把盘面带出工作区</h3><div class="output-sizes" role="group" aria-label="预览 PNG 导出倍率">{[1,2,3].map(scale=><button type="button" disabled data-output-size={scale} aria-pressed={scale===2}>{scale}×</button>)}</div></div><p>1×、2×、3× 导出 PNG，或复制 2× 图片。<br />图片保留发起输出时可见的标注。</p><a class="text-link" href="/guide/#export">图片导出与复制 <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a></div>
  </article>
 </div>
</section>
